From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:21:36 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Windows ARM32: MIDL outputs for the updater's legacy
 interfaces

Chrome's browser layer includes the updater's legacy COM interfaces
(updater_legacy_idl), and Chromium ships MIDL's outputs for x86, x64 and
arm64 only. These are midl.exe's own for /env arm32, as midl.py asks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
